{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Evil Origin</strong> is a dark fantasy, gothic horror JRPG inspired by classics like <i>Koudelka</i> and <i>Shadow Hearts</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features a rich narrative with deep lore, cinematic cutscenes, and blood pumping turn-based combat with a wide array of magic to use against your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666890/extras/battleclip.gif?t=1748579006\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this early preview demo of Evil Origin, step into the role of a <u>Kresnik</u>; a highly trained monster hunter that specializes in exorcising vampiric demons known as <u>Kudlak</u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After tracking down his mark, the Kresnik arrives at an abandoned castle located in a remote section of Dyad\u2019s Lower Planes.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo allows you to explore the first floor of the castle, which features various puzzles, hidden secrets, and deadly encounters.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3666890?t=1748579006","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3666890?t=1748579006","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666890/52ffb672800a638a19fcb13b53cc08ba567e1ae5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748579006","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666890/52ffb672800a638a19fcb13b53cc08ba567e1ae5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748579006","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Evil Origin</strong> is a dark fantasy, gothic horror JRPG inspired by classics like <i>Koudelka</i> and <i>Shadow Hearts</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features a rich narrative with deep lore, cinematic cutscenes, and blood pumping turn-based combat with a wide array of magic to use against your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666890/extras/battleclip.gif?t=1748579006\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this early preview demo of Evil Origin, step into the role of a <u>Kresnik</u>; a highly trained monster hunter that specializes in exorcising vampiric demons known as <u>Kudlak</u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After tracking down his mark, the Kresnik arrives at an abandoned castle located in a remote section of Dyad\u2019s Lower Planes.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo allows you to explore the first floor of the castle, which features various puzzles, hidden secrets, and deadly encounters.</p>","developers":["Kevin Musto"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3666820","name":"Evil Origin"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666890/d735fc984ce39f4055b041436a8b4d6784d03d73/header.jpg?t=1748579006","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257125433,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125433/movie480.mp4?t=1748574059","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125433/movie_max.mp4?t=1748574059"},"name":"Evil Origin Demo Trailer